        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"aebd632d-5099-4cb6-8046-8b3ee8779bc1\",\"review_text\":\"Music Music & More Music\"},{\"review_id\":\"69f072f2-f808-483c-9c38-82202354b288\",\"review_text\":\"Been waiting for this merge!\"},{\"review_id\":\"d0a09e14-602d-4dd4-9812-7957a66f3a63\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this Sweden I love Islam alhumdullah\"},{\"review_id\":\"5014576b-fe43-437a-a951-0f66c978ed04\",\"review_text\":\"Leider wird mir jedes Mal, wenn ich den Podcast \\\"Hobbylos\\\" höre, eine längere Werbung geschaltet. Das ist sehr ärgerlich, da ich den Podcast immer zum Einschlafen höre und ich von dieser aufdringlichen Werbung gestört werde. Des Weiteren bezahle ich monatlich 14€ und erwarte daher, keine Werbung zu erhalten. Bitte beheben Sie dieses Problem.\"},{\"review_id\":\"164d3fa0-723f-4325-a12e-9fa85edde9de\",\"review_text\":\"I like it so much this app is very good but the ads are so long but I can deal with it\"},{\"review_id\":\"77addbc6-5850-4a01-8f95-43e99db84634\",\"review_text\":\"I don't know what the issue is buh my songs just stop playing all of a sudden. I can't listen to a full song without having to go back and press play, all this while the song is even downloaded. It's getting really annoying.\"},{\"review_id\":\"54170145-62a5-4479-a197-4dbad73ab9a7\",\"review_text\":\"Great sevice\"},{\"review_id\":\"367e8018-da58-4e0f-8767-630aa4530bdd\",\"review_text\":\"Can't play music over cellular data\"},{\"review_id\":\"5204362b-fdec-4111-9e9f-7514b4f2c852\",\"review_text\":\"Not interested bakwad\"},{\"review_id\":\"ac066106-d8a7-4d4b-90a1-f5ff99667529\",\"review_text\":\"Easy to use but im broke and I hate ads\"}]}"
